    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "No latency histogram for ValidatePolicyAgainstFloor, impact preview, report generation, or the retention tick",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 55 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Only outcome counters exist for these four operations - no `_duration_seconds` histogram, so this dashboard cannot show p50/p95/p99 latency for any of them (unlike the rollup job's own `compliance_rollup_job_lag_seconds`). A real, disclosed gap (docs/module-08-phase-8-production-readiness-checklist.md), not fixed this phase. Separately: `AdherenceScore`/`OccupancyRecord`/`ShrinkageRecord` (the rollup jobs' own output) have no GraphQL or REST read query anywhere in this module - the single largest functional gap as of Phase 8 (docs/adr/0107) - so no panel here can show rollup *content*, only the job's own run/lag metrics. No Prometheus alerting rule exists for any panel on this dashboard - confirmed platform-wide, not a Module 08-specific gap (docs/adr/0107)."
      }
    }
